oft-style area on the second floor. The HUB at Westside Reserve is a GATED COMMUNITY that features a clubhouse, Amazon and Instacart Lockers, BBQ grills, EV charging stations, a Zen garden, a fitness center, a dog park, and a community swimming pool. Ideally located, you're just one block from Highway 192 and minutes from Disney World. Don't miss this opportunity! Be the first to schedule your showing today. Directions: W. Irlo Bronson (US 192) -Turn on Lindfields Blvd - Turn right on Styles Blvd - Left on Millenia in the Hub - Units are on the right side. LRES Property Management Residents are enrolled in the Resident Benefits Package (RBP) for $45.95/month which includes mandatory renters insurance, HVAC air filter delivery (for applicable properties), credit building to help boost your credit score with timely rent payments, $1M Identity Protection, move-in concierge service making utility connection and home service setup a breeze during your move-in, our best-in-class resident rewards program, and much more! More details upon application. ***Must see the property before applications are submitted** ** Pets are allowed; however, you must go through PETSCREENING.COM for enrollment - Two pets max. Pet Deposit of $350.00 - Non-Refundable, and a monthly pet fee. Qualifications: There is a $105 non-refundable application fee PER ADULT. We look for a credit score of 600+, no eviction histories, and income equaling at least 3 times the monthly rent. Sec Dep is equal to one month's rent and is due upon approval. Additional fees apply once selected for tenancy. ***Must see the property before applications are submitted** By submitting your information on this page you consent to being contacted by the Property Manager and RentEngine via SMS, phone, or email.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1749,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/a4ef6d6c546f5419a3cea423431d505el-m508735467r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["condo","road","exterior"],